	quest.1A06E821013D5994.title: "Fuel Rods"
	quest.1A12C5A9732CCDA9.quest_desc: [
		"Extreme Reactors lets you design your own reactor. Any size from 3x3x3 up to huge. A bigger reactor with more fuel rods makes more power."
		""
		"This chapter walks you through a small passive reactor first, then a turbine setup and finally reprocessing and top-tier materials. Start with some coal to make graphite."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 32 x Coal and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1A12C5A9732CCDA9.title: "Build a Reactor"
	quest.1C6188AD981E9D5B.quest_desc: [
		"Pulls energy out of a passive reactor."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Reactor Active Forge Energy Power Tap (Basic) and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1C6188AD981E9D5B.title: "Power Tap"
