	]
	quest.23664CB82ACADAC8.title: "Reactor Casing"
	quest.32EE1D1C5873AF5F.quest_desc: [
		"§eBuilding your first reactor:§r make a 5x5x5 hollow box of Reactor Casing. Replace one wall block with the Controller, one with an Access Port and one with a Power Tap."
		""
		"Inside, put fuel rod columns with a control rod on top of each column (in the top face). Right-click the controller: if the multiblock is valid, it turns on!"
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Reactor Controller (Basic) and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.32EE1D1C5873AF5F.title: "Controller"
	quest.46212D2739385BD8.quest_desc: [
