		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Reprocessor Controller and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in. §7(Optional: you can skip this one.)§r"
	]
	quest.542AC73D5D5702B3.title: "Reprocessor"
	quest.5D57987B8C5225C6.quest_desc: [
		"A multiblock that turns solid fuels into liquid ones for the biggest reactors."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Fluidizer Controller and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in. §7(Optional: you can skip this one.)§r"
	]
	quest.5D57987B8C5225C6.title: "Fluidizer"
	quest.601AE6B0E1E48279.quest_desc: [
		"Fill the empty space around fuel rods with a moderator (like water, a block of graphite or diamond) to change how efficient the reactor is. Experiment with it!"
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot Water Bucket and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.601AE6B0E1E48279.title: "Moderators"
	quest.60A188FF39CB8314.quest_desc: [
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Ridiculite Ingot and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.60A188FF39CB8314.title: "Ridiculite"
	quest.7AD90A3427217C55.quest_desc: [
		"An §eActive reactor§r uses Coolant Ports instead of a Power Tap. It turns water into steam, and a turbine turns steam into far more power than a passive reactor."
		""
		"Build a turbine of turbine casings with a rotor shaft running up the middle, bearing at the bottom, blades on the shaft and coils (like iron or gold blocks) around the top of the shaft."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Turbine Controller (Basic) and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.7AD90A3427217C55.title: "Turbine"
